SUMMARY="GStreamer video and audio file thumbnailer"
DESCRIPTION="GStreamer Thumbnailers
This project provides two binaries that create a thumbnails for the libgnome-desktop thumbnailer:

gst-video-thumbnailer tries to extract the stored cover art from a video file. If no cover art is \
found, it checks a few different frames and takes the frame with the largest variance between \
it's the pixels.
gst-audio-thumbnailer tries to extract the stored cover art from an audio file."
HOMEPAGE="https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gst-thumbnailers"
COPYRIGHT="2026 GNOME developers"
LICENSE="GNU GPL v3"
REVISION="1"
